fan_migrated.description:
Fans are now fan entities instead of climate entities, so {old} became {new}. Its name, area and voice assistant settings came along, but these automations or scripts still use the old entity:

{users}

Do you need to act? Yes: change {old} to {new} in them. "climate.set_hvac_mode" with "off" becomes "fan.turn_off", and "fan_only" becomes "fan.turn_on". This notice goes away by itself when nothing uses the old entity.

{joke}
